    <briefdescription>
<para>Traits class mapping a coefficient ring <computeroutput>RT</computeroutput> to its preferred homotopy algorithm tag. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The primary template selects <computeroutput><ref refid="class_trivial_homotopy_algorithm" kindref="compound">TrivialHomotopyAlgorithm</ref></computeroutput>; explicit specialisations override that choice for specific numeric rings. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_s_l_evaluator_concrete" kindref="compound">SLEvaluatorConcrete</ref>&lt;RT&gt;::createHomotopy</computeroutput> consults <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_homotopy_algorithm" kindref="compound">HomotopyAlgorithm</ref>&lt;RT&gt;::<ref refid="struct_homotopy_algorithm_ad1316d26e694b98666c7971fc9a58d18_1ad1316d26e694b98666c7971fc9a58d18" kindref="member">Algorithm</ref></computeroutput> to pick the right <computeroutput><ref refid="class_homotopy_concrete" kindref="compound">HomotopyConcrete</ref></computeroutput> specialisation. </para>
